<title>USA: PennFirst sets 10-pct stock dividend.</title>
<headline>PennFirst sets 10-pct stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>ELLWOOD CITY, Pa. 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>PennFirst Bancorp Inc said Wednesday its board of directors had declared a special 10-percent common stock dividend.</p>
<p>The bank said in a statement the stock dividend will be payable on August 25 to shareholders of record on July 31.</p>
<p>It said the dividend will raise the number of outstanding shares of common stock to 5.3 million from 4.8 million.</p>
<p>PennFirst said the regular quarterly cash dividend will remain at $0.09 a share after the special stock dividend, for an effective increase of 10 percent.</p>
